&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; line-height: 16px; text-align: left"&gt;Moriroku (Singapore) Pte., Ltd.、Moriroku (Thailand) Co., Ltd.、Moriroku Chemicals Korea Co., Ltd.、PT. Moriroku Chemicals Indonesia、Moriroku Chemicals India Private Limited、&lt;/p&gt;
